cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Fraud Desk or Fraud Desk Bench, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Fraud Desk: a multi-agent fraud and AML investigation desk on the raw Claude API"
abstract: >-
  A multi-agent fraud and AML investigation desk, built in public over 60 days, with a
  pre-registered eval comparing ML-only, single-agent and multi-agent arms on recall,
  false positives, grounding, cost per case, latency and prompt-injection resistance.
authors:
