url: "https://github.com/aurimas13/Fraud-Desk"
license: MIT
version: 0.0.1
date-released: "2026-11-02"
keywords:
  - multi-agent
  - ai-agents
  - anti-money-laundering
  - fraud-detection
  - llm-evaluation
  - prompt-injection
  - claude
